    <tr><td>Positional therapy</td><td>Events mainly when lying on the back</td><td>Long-term use often drops off</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Weight loss</td><td>Anyone carrying excess weight</td><td>Helps every other treatment; benefit fades if weight returns</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Nasal surgery</td><td>Blocked nose, poor CPAP tolerance</td><td>Improves breathing and comfort; rarely enough on its own</td></tr>
